/apps/server/src/http/auth/             @faizannraza

# --- Protected: the quality bar -----------------------------------------------------------------
# `M0-T17`'s AC names these explicitly, and the reason is that they are the dials somebody would
# turn to make a failing gate pass: an eval threshold, a judge's rubric, or a golden transcript
# that defines "correct". Lowering one looks exactly like fixing a test.
/packages/evals/src/thresholds/          @faizannraza
/packages/evals/src/judges/              @faizannraza
/packages/evals/__golden__/              @faizannraza
**/__golden__/                           @faizannraza

